# local env files (API keys etc. must never be committed)
# Everything but the checked-in template: `.env` and `.env*.local` alone left
# ordinary variants like `.env.bak` or `.env.openai` committable, which is a
# one-typo route to publishing a key.
.env*
!.env.example

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android
